WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.201
Welcome to Module 4 of the
HR-Driven Identity learning path:

2
00:00:04.201 --> 00:00:08.437
assign access from attributes,
and review what a move leaves.

3
00:00:08.437 --> 00:00:14.376
This is Gate 4, Access and movers, with
Chapter 04 of the developer workbook.

4
00:00:14.376 --> 00:00:19.013
Module 3 got a new hire ready on
day one, with an onboarding package.

5
00:00:19.013 --> 00:00:21.487
Department access comes from this gate.

6
00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:26.214
In this module you'll lint access package
assignment policies before they reach the

7
00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:29.590
tenant, scan the tenant's policies
for the member-of operator,

8
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:33.438
and list what a move leaves behind
for the manager of record to review.

9
00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:38.538
The code runs on your laptop, against a
fictional population and a fictional mover.

10
00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:43.920
It's illustrative: unit-tested against
fixtures, not run against a live tenant.
